<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Ported from Figma's SVG export of "Illustration band (cronómetro)" — the
  bottom decoration for Partidos (Voy tab), the one with the glowing
  stopwatch + dashed reminder trail + doodle. Two adaptations, same reasoning
  as ic_illustration_band_calendario.xml:
  1. stroke-dasharray ("3 5" on the stopwatch's top arc, "1 6" on the long
     reminder trail) has no VectorDrawable equivalent, so both were left as
     continuous strokes — low-opacity decorative lines, reads the same.
  2. the background wash is an elliptical radial gradient; approximated here
     with a circular gradient sized to the ellipse's larger axis.
-->
